OL,3,GNEWSAVictorian gasworks turned into
OL,4,Aheat pump network
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Victorian gasworks has been turned
OL,7,Finto a #75m heat pump network that will
OL,8,Fsupply warmth to courts, council
OL,9,Fbuildings, a university and a college.
OL,11,FThe Bradford Heat Network, in Thornton
OL,12,FRoad, which began operating earlier,
OL,13,Fuses air source heat pumps to warm
OL,14,Fwater, which is then run through
OL,15,Funderground pipes to customers.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
