OL,3,GNEWSAVictorian gasworks turned into
OL,4,Aheat pump network
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeveloped by low-carbon heat network
OL,7,Fdeveloper 1Energy, the project will
OL,8,Feventually use waste heat from a
OL,9,Fplanned 5.6-megawatt data centre on
OL,10,FThornton Road, and is expected to cut
OL,11,Fcarbon emissions for the companies that
OL,12,Fuse it by at least 75%.
OL,14,FJohn Hartley, CEO of 1Energy, said the
OL,15,Fproject would put Bradford at the
OL,16,Fforefront of modern energy
OL,17,Finfrastructure.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
